  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">519GLO4000 focuses on the Promotion and Conservation of Cultural Heritage.

The NFiT is structured around: 
 &#x2022; Strategic Orientations of 1992 (i.e. Implementation of the Global Strategy; Education; Technical Cooperation; and Periodic Reporting);
 &#x2022; Strategic Objectives of the World Heritage Committee (5C&apos;s: Credibility, Conservation, Capacity Building, Communication and Communities), and the World Heritage Goals which have since become the guiding principles for the implementation of the World Heritage Convention.</narrative>
  </description>
